ml#code\">code</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Resolution status<br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">Binding: </span><a href=\"ValueSet-KGResolutionStatusVS.html\" title=\"http://smart.who.int/base/ValueSet/KGResolutionStatusVS\" class=\"binding\">Knowledge graph L1: resolution status</a><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/terminologies.html#required\" title=\"To be conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the specified value set.\" class=\"binding\">required</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table></div></div>"
